================================================================================
PROMPT CORPORA
================================================================================

prompts/indic22_bench.jsonl  (2100 rows)
    Generated by Rumik AI for this benchmark. Not extracted from any external
    corpus. The wiki / book / news / conv / alexa / bb / umang / proper_noun
    tags are REGISTER labels -- the style a prompt is written in -- not source
    attributions.

prompts/curated_hard_50.jsonl  (1050 rows)
    Generated with Google Gemini and curated by Rumik AI.

prompts/heldout_v1.jsonl  (180 rows)
    50 rows from indic22_bench, plus 130 rows from FLEURS.

    The FLEURS rows are licensed CC BY 4.0 and are attributed as required:

        FLEURS: Few-shot Learning Evaluation of Universal Representations
        of Speech.  Conneau, Ma, Khanuja, Zhang, Axelrod, Dalmia, Riesa,
        Rivera and Bapna.  IEEE SLT, 2023.
        https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

    They carry the `fleurs` tag, so they can be filtered if a set free of
    third-party material is needed.

